Source: https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer
Commit: c9f0f0d90a22b1734733297ec09f0f44d21927cf

The implementation in csrc/smxx/fwd_kernel_fused.cuh is adapted from:
  flashkda_bf16_fused_m128_vtile_d589dad375
  flashkda_bf16_fused_m128_vtile_4b7d3b6523

Local modifications: renamed layouts and operands, reused scalar utilities,
removed unused helpers and serving/checkpoint paths, passed TMA descriptors
as grid-constant parameters, and added general head counts, packed sequence
boundaries, tail handling, optional state and empty-sequence handling.
All fused calls use the VTile Direct arithmetic and CTA/warp schedule.
No upstream multi-family policy or generated dispatch registry is included.
